<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="uz">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <title>Go by Example — O'zbekcha</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Go dasturlash tilini o'zbek tilida izohlangan misol dasturlar orqali o'rganing — Go by Example'ning o'zbekcha tarjimasi.">
    <link rel=stylesheet href="site.css">
    <link rel="icon" type="image/x-icon" href="favicon.ico">
  </head>
  <body>
    <div id="intro">
      <h2><a href="./">Go by Example</a></h2>
      <p>
        <a href="https://go.dev">Go</a> — kengaytiriladigan,
        xavfsiz va ishonchli dasturiy ta'minot yaratish uchun
        mo'ljallangan ochiq kodli dasturlash tili.
        Batafsil ma'lumot olish uchun
        <a href="https://go.dev/doc/tutorial/getting-started">rasmiy hujjatlarni</a>
        o'qing.
      </p>

      <p>
        <em>Go by Example</em> — izohlangan misol dasturlar
        yordamida Go tilini amaliy o'rganish. <a href="hello-world">Birinchi
        misolni</a> ko'ring yoki quyidagi to'liq ro'yxatni
        ko'zdan kechiring.
      </p>

      <p>
        Boshqacha ko'rsatilmagan bo'lsa, bu yerdagi misollar
        <a href="https://go.dev/doc/devel/release">Go'ning eng so'nggi asosiy versiyasini</a>
        nazarda tutadi va tilning yangi imkoniyatlaridan foydalanishi
        mumkin. Agar biror narsa ishlamasa, eng so'nggi versiyaga
        yangilab ko'ring.
      </p>

      <ul>
      {{range .}}
        <li><a href="{{.ID}}">{{.Name}}</a></li>
      {{end}}
      </ul>
{{ template "footer" }}
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
